{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0016",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01175",
      "en": "So, Shuri, what will you have?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01182",
      "en": "Ah, I'll have mine after my Master.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01184",
      "en": "Saying that, Shuri stood diagonally behind me.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01191",
      "en": "What's wrong, Shuri?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01193",
      "en": "Rinsha called out to Shuri curiously.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01200",
      "en": "Yes, allow me to serve.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01207",
      "en": "Serve...?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01209",
      "en": "Rinsha's eyes, now dots, turned to me.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01212",
      "en": "Shuri, sit down.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01219",
      "en": "But, Master...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01221",
      "en": "This is the usual exchange...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01222",
      "en": "Whenever we eat out, Shuri always does this.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01223",
      "en": "She tries to volunteer as a server.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01225",
      "en": "If left alone, she'd serve perfectly, but...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01226",
      "en": "At the mansion it's fine, but in a restaurant...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01227",
      "en": "It's extremely conspicuous...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01234",
      "en": "That's right, Shuri. Our food isn't so hard",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01235",
      "en": "that you need to stand and serve.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01236",
      "en": "Besides, it'd be sad to make your Master eat alone.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01243",
      "en": "...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01246",
      "en": "Shuri.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01249",
      "en": "Yes, as you wish...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01251",
      "en": "Urged, Shuri finally stepped from behind me...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01252",
      "en": "Shuri's posture as she sat down awkwardly...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01253",
      "en": "It wasn't reluctance, but rather nervousness.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01256",
      "en": "I'll have this.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01258",
      "en": "I looked at Shuri, cheeks flushed and head down,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01259",
      "en": "I pointed to the dish Rinsha recommended.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01266",
      "en": "Yes, and you, Shuri?",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
